From: Beryl 7 reproducible build <beryl7-build@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] golang: backport 1.26.9 from openwrt-25.12

Tailscale 1.102.3 declares Go 1.26.6 as its minimum toolchain.  The
source-pinned packages feed still contains Go 1.26.1 and OpenWrt forces
GOTOOLCHAIN=local, so the Tailscale build otherwise exits before compiling.

Use the final recipe state from OpenWrt packages commit
54fab7fa4224193a121f49a9f39dafd9323a0b2d, folding the intervening Go 1.26
patch releases into this source-pinned feed.  The resulting 1.26.9 recipe also
carries the current Go 1.26 security fixes.

---
 lang/golang/golang1.26/Makefile | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/lang/golang/golang1.26/Makefile b/lang/golang/golang1.26/Makefile
index 6b364fb..fa33ddd 100644
--- a/lang/golang/golang1.26/Makefile
+++ b/lang/golang/golang1.26/Makefile
@@ -11 +11 @@
-GO_VERSION_PATCH:=1
+GO_VERSION_PATCH:=9
@@ -14 +14 @@
-PKG_HASH:=3172293d04b209dc1144698e7ba13f0477f6ba8c5ffd0be66c20fdbc9785dfbb
+PKG_HASH:=9735d7dcdb65b35d3fa577f04064737c03b89cf1a2b71e6e69fe2f3c6f9fd4ca
-- 
2.47.3
